<title>USA: FirstFed Bancshares Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>FirstFed Bancshares Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss primary	 $0.35   profit	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,257   profit	   824</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,574		    4,145</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 3,571		    4,125</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit primary     $0.27   profit	$ 0.50</p>
<p> Net profit		   984   profit	 2,161</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,586		    4,294</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 3,611		    4,254</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include one-time charge to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding the effects of the SAIF charge, results were net income of $824,000 or $0.20/shr in the Q3 and net income of $2,972,000 or $0.83/shr for the nine months.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
